            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Compact disc collection of commercially-released classical music recordings covering the medieval through modern periods. Collection contains individual albums, box sets, liner notes, books with accompanying discs, and pamphlets.\r\n\r\nRequest items from this collection by email (muslibref@stanford.edu) or by speaking directly to a librarian in the Stanford Music Library. Be sure to indicate box #, item #, and CD title; please also include your contact information. These CDs are paged from offsite storage and will typically take 3-5 business days to process.",
